=== CANDIDATE 1: LINKED TILES (two marked tiles always turn together) ===
  linked    min moves 4    solvable states 1    reachable 256
  unlinked  min moves 5    solvable states 1    reachable 512

=== CANDIDATE 2: TIDE BASIN (only overflows once fed from two sides) ===
  basin     min moves 5    solvable states 1    reachable 1024
  as cross  min moves 2    solvable states 259  reachable 1024
